{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it, take and move it to destination. Perform specific task. Avoid obstacles or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeavy    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    />\"",
